IR Content:
```yaml
xcpgir_version: "1.0"
rule:
  id: subprocess-injection
  kind: taint
  severity: ERROR
  message: >-
    Detected user input entering a `subprocess` call unsafely. This could
    result in a command injection vulnerability. An attacker could use this
    vulnerability to execute arbitrary commands on the host, which allows
    them to download malware, scan sensitive data, or run any command they
    wish on the server. Do not let users choose the command to run. In general,
    prefer to use Python API versions of system commands. If you must use subprocess,
    use a dictionary to allowlist a set of commands.
  metadata:
    language: python
    category: security
    technology:
    - flask
    owasp:
    - A01:2017 - Injection
    - A03:2021 - Injection
    cwe:
    - "CWE-78: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an OS Command ('OS Command Injection')"
    references:
    - https://semgrep.dev/docs/cheat-sheets/python-command-injection/

sources:
  - id: FLASK_USER_INPUT
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        package: flask.request
        methods:
          - form.get
          - form.__getitem__
          - args.get
          - args.__getitem__
          - values.get
          - values.__getitem__
          - cookies.get
          - cookies.__getitem__
          - headers.get
          - headers.__getitem__
          - view_args.get
          - view_args.__getitem__
          - get_json
      - id: ROUTE_PARAM
        match:
          node: METHOD_PARAMETER_IN
          where:
            - op: inside
              left: METHOD
              right: "@$APP.route($ROUTE, ...)"

sinks:
  - id: SUBPROCESS_CALL
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        package: subprocess
        methods:
          - Popen
          - run
          - call
          - check_call
          - check_output
      where:
        - op: not_eq
          left: arg[0].value
          right: "..."
        - op: not_eq
          left: arg[0].value[0].value
          right: "..."
        - op: not_regex
          left: arg[0].value[0].value
          right: "^(sh|bash|ksh|csh|tcsh|zsh)$"
        - op: not_regex
          left: arg[0].value[0].value
          right: "^(python|python\\d)$"

sanitizers:
  - id: DICT_KEY_LOOKUP
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        package: builtins
        method: dict.__getitem__
    effect: neutralize
    scope:
      focus_meta: $KEY

propagations:
  - id: DIRECT_ARGUMENT
    edge: arg->param
    kind: taint
```
Valid: ```yaml
issues:
  - "Sources节点中缺少flask.request.stream/flask.request.data/flask.request.full_path/flask.request.url/flask.request.json等方法的映射"
  - "改进建议：在FLASK_USER_INPUT的api.methods中添加stream/data/full_path/url/json方法"
  - "Sources节点中对ROUTE_PARAM的处理不够完整，缺少对$ROUTEVAR的显式指定"
  - "改进建议：在ROUTE_PARAM的where条件中添加对focus_metavariable的显式声明"
  - "Sinks节点中对subprocess.$FUNC(["$SHELL"])的检测逻辑对应不足"
  - "改进建议：在SUBPROCESS_CALL的where条件中添加对shell解释器的显式阻止条件"
```
